

The Tarot Reader will attempt to predict your
future and determine your destiny using the 78
card Tarot deck.  It is similar to a modern day
card deck except that it has 1 extra card per suit
and 22 other cards called the Major Arcana.  The
Major Arcana are said to be suggestive of magic
and mystery, with cards like 'The Tower' and 'The
Wheel of Fortune'.  They are not related to the
modern day cards.

The Tarot Card Reader will deal 10 cards from the
deck of 78.  First you must think of a question to
ask it, then you will be asked to shuffle then
deck.  The cards will be dealt one at a time.

Each card has two meanings, one for right-side up
and another for reversed.  That's 156 possible
meanings.  Each card also has a position meaning.
First the position meaning will be printed, then
then card meaning.  Evaluate each card meaning in
relation to your question and its position in the
deal.


